{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Button Defense</strong> is a minimalist yet highly addictive defense game where your only control is switching the rotation of your weapon \u2013 clockwise or counterclockwise.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Infinite Challenge</strong> \u2013 Just one button to reverse your weapon's rotation, but the enemies never stop coming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Visual Effects</strong> \u2013 Minimal shapes, maximum particle effects for a satisfying dopamine rush.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Difficulty Scaling</strong> \u2013 Survive as long as you can while the challenge ramps up without limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; Survival Records</strong> \u2013 Compete with yourself or friends for the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Modding Support</strong> \u2013 Add JS files to the mods/ folder or code directly in the in-game mod editor. Create new weapons, change enemy behavior, or break the rules entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores, experimenting with crazy mods, or just enjoying the chaos, <strong>One Button Defense</strong> delivers quick, intense fun you can jump into anytime.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501840?t=1755853287","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501840?t=1755853287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501840/0db6e9471707637dfa7659c1d12eb4c3e32cf194/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755853287","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501840/0db6e9471707637dfa7659c1d12eb4c3e32cf194/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755853287","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Button Defense</strong> is a minimalist yet highly addictive defense game where your only control is switching the rotation of your weapon \u2013 clockwise or counterclockwise.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Infinite Challenge</strong> \u2013 Just one button to reverse your weapon's rotation, but the enemies never stop coming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Visual Effects</strong> \u2013 Minimal shapes, maximum particle effects for a satisfying dopamine rush.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Difficulty Scaling</strong> \u2013 Survive as long as you can while the challenge ramps up without limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score &amp; Survival Records</strong> \u2013 Compete with yourself or friends for the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Modding Support</strong> \u2013 Add JS files to the mods/ folder or code directly in the in-game mod editor. Create new weapons, change enemy behavior, or break the rules entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores, experimenting with crazy mods, or just enjoying the chaos, <strong>One Button Defense</strong> delivers quick, intense fun you can jump into anytime.</p>","developers":["LunaStev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501840/57f3bc26d73adb39f794aca2202ec9d9d6d8b94e/header.jpg?t=1755853287","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3501840/1714061177/e753ef290adf89c7506e303277ccbf74a65a66ff/1754451276/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754710780","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/